sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Sender
  participant SA as Sender app
  participant FS as Cloud Firestore
  participant CF as Cloud Functions
  participant RA as Receiver app
  actor R as Receiver
  S->>SA: Type a message or pick photos
  SA->>FS: Read requests/id/private/chatKey (create it on first use)
  FS-->>SA: 256-bit key (readable only by the customer and the hired artisan)
  SA->>SA: Encrypt text and photo links (XSalsa20-Poly1305)
  SA->>FS: Create requests/id/messages/mid with cipher only
  FS-)CF: onMessageCreated
  CF->>FS: newMessage notification without the text, push sent
  FS-->>RA: Live update (onSnapshot)
  RA->>RA: Decrypt with the same key
  RA-->>R: Show the message
